# The uncompressed raw reports are regenerable and large (88.3 MB for the three merged
# reports). What is committed is the gzipped merged report for each K, which contains every
# per-question attempt record, plus summary.json and the score-sorted diagnostic parts.
#
#   gunzip -k locomo-k10.json.gz     # restore a full raw report
#
*.json
!summary.json
